# Placeholder CA certificate for Mosquitto broker.
#
# Replace this file with the actual CA certificate (ca.crt) from your
# Mosquitto installation.
#
# To get it:
#   From the mosquitto/ directory in this repo (after running setup):
#   Copy  mosquitto/certs/ca.crt  to this file.
#
# Or if using a managed broker (e.g. EMQX Cloud), download their root CA.
#
# This placeholder keeps the build working. TLS will not function until
# the real cert is placed here.
